{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d5038823469a5ee1c041b411383425dcf207aa327e8cd30a55f00c857dbb9bd9", "ja": "（明日のライブのリハーサルが終わった。\n千早の調子もよかったし、問題はなさそうだ）", "zh": "（明天演唱会的排练结束了。\n千早的状况不错，应该没问题了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5886e4abf775de0fda8f76ce758866a181e93abe986c8216921eff062ba2b498", "ja": "（安心したら、なんだか眠くなってきたな……。\n海風も気持ちいいし、波の音も……いい感じで……）", "zh": "（一放心下来，突然变得有点困……\n而且海风又舒服，海浪声……也很催眠……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "9bb973527ec64dd28e27d3bb25260c6416095ea637af9364825ed24c6fee4df2", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\n……{$P$}？", "zh": "{$P$}，工作辛苦了。\n……{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "311cd8e3a2f68bf03098823b1a0e8994bff7240861cb0a9de72b571c21de6cbc", "ja": "……！？　うわっ！！", "zh": "……！？哇！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8d9cc24b3c8cbd7d21eca27514769f50d1a2d09b90fecf65cafc05644f666daa", "ja": "……って、千早か。ビックリした……。\nごめん、ちょっとぼんやりしてて。", "zh": "……是千早啊，吓我一跳……\n抱歉，我刚才有点恍神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b53b1fde75cd33b82f42ea32d55477809ff56e494ed40ba9476ed8bf9b1d41b1", "ja": "いえ、私のほうこそ、驚かせてしまって……。あ。", "zh": "不会，我才要道歉，吓到你了……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "828c0d12e82dd3ec8e0f48c972162e1c70c5380e160d8bece96cc8a57f8ef165", "ja": "「あ」ってなんだ？", "zh": "你「啊」一声是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "7d67c138c9ac52b39f4be079d51350e9af396bca534d67cc7b9ba61b2034cc88", "ja": "す、すみません。私も驚いたせいか、\n言おうとしていたこと……忘れてしまいました。", "zh": "对、对不起，可能我自己也吓了一跳，\n结果忘记本来要说什么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ff53d4dcb78872bfac9674051ee2799a9899b5bd3d494f4c8dddd502a9e9c4f5", "ja": "な、なるほど……困ったな。明日のライブに関わる\nことだったりしたら、大変だし……。", "zh": "原、原来如此……真伤脑筋，\n如果是有关明天演唱会的事，那就不妙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "7e92cd717da2bb078827aa815bfe2a1cdb0782b1442553a5f6b45003ea751642", "ja": "たしか海を見ていて……。今からまた海をみて、\n思い出します。……あ、時間、ありませんか？", "zh": "我记得我是看着海……我现在再看一次海\n试着回想看看……啊，你是不是没时间？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1e51f8b5ab211b26442abf4ef794943432e5c6d2587320f4d34328787eb7757d", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。二人でゆっくり海を\n眺めながら、待つとするか。", "zh": "不会，没关系。不如我们两个人就\n一起悠哉地看海，等你回想起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "8c98122ac0e307f2fa2fd11acc72a60d774c6946f1571524b0bb71e2c77d2c62", "ja": "すみません、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "不好意思，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "e9c27a5c6d7208308b0e2ad76664851695be0dd6e44a5941fb4b8305ed5da941", "ja": "ふぅ……。波の音、心地いいですね。\n海風も、気持ちよくて。", "zh": "呼……海浪声听着很舒适呢，\n海风吹着也很舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bfd1a497562813530ecdea56ec2873518828e9107155f0d8a4fe42dd18ca532c", "ja": "……ああ、そうだな。", "zh": "……嗯，对啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "0244a2cf754adbcdc05f144c444ab932249dfceb1ae5afc6af7079eb9a638d4a", "ja": "……あの……。\n海を眺める予定だったのでは？", "zh": "请问……\n我们不是要看海吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ca3b54f83fe0f2cc23bb3ff6cfb48872a958cc9dc35d49af8676c6894d2802ee", "ja": "あ、いや、ごめん。海に向かってたたずむ千早を\n見ていたら、ちょっと思ったんだ。", "zh": "啊，没错，抱歉。\n看着面向大海伫立的千早，我突然有个念头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d2c8a51b5b086392d288ca2838177879fb764fb709aa427a9921ef8d817f9448", "ja": "まるで、陸に上がった人魚姫みたいだな……って。", "zh": "觉得你好像……上到陆地的人鱼公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "fa79303d34cebd3e2f6d40ef59b6122ea52c02a620164e3e86129afd1e1dbfde", "ja": "すごく……不思議です。", "zh": "这……真是不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1022_p", "source_sha256": "247fa20c9e96f66d1ee9d9c3a63b3cc6f1c805e8f75710582044befb57aed842", "ja": "そうだな、ヘンだよな。\nごめんごめん、唐突だった。", "zh": "是啊，很奇怪吧。\n抱歉抱歉，我太唐突了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "8b087d0fa5b2cd2699f12a8f799b90b32eed9bfbb667ac5b037a89392c73ae87", "ja": "いえ、そうではなく。\nさっき言おうとしていたこと、思い出しました。", "zh": "不，我不是说你怪，\n而是想起我刚才要说什么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "6945760403e887e3970cf5d8cd6e094802fc43b6fbe3ff012734b8605322c2e5", "ja": "リハーサルで、海風と波の音を感じながら歌って\nいたら……自分が人魚になったような気がした。", "zh": "排练时，我一边感受着海风和海浪声一边唱歌……\n赫然觉得自己好像变成了人鱼一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "81e7f6965d03f6632a9e99de064468c7e626c5922212342deda1cb266a600506", "ja": "……言いたかったのは、そういう話です。", "zh": "我想说的就是这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3d2458e38e0afb488ab063e8e6a20d2520630e8a9256f92157321427a8efa02c", "ja": "……なんだ。\nつまり、同じことを思いついたってことか。", "zh": "什么嘛……\n原来我们想到的是同一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "685efcb0e695562e2ded59f7d18fa1752a5717d8115a3b47907233a57970ae35", "ja": "そうですね。あ、すみません、わざわざ思い出す\nほどのことじゃなくて！　でも……。", "zh": "就是啊。啊，对不起，\n结果不是什么值得特地回想的事！不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0124_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "7438d37a45a0002a35780181b52faea23be9cfcfe33fe3020e4195f1cfe198fa", "ja": "思い出せて……、よかったです。", "zh": "我很庆幸……自己有想起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
